{
  "$comment": [
    "The CROSS-LANGUAGE conformance vector for the voter proof-of-possession `seam-voter-pop-v1` (#1687,",
    "docs/specs/voter-verification.v1.md). framed(x) = u32_LE(len(x)) | x; F(x) = u64_BE(len(x)) | x.",
    "",
    "content_digest = SHA-256(framed(`seam-vote-content-v1`) | framed(mode) | framed(proposal_id) | framed(content) |",
    "  framed(u32_LE(n)) | framed(participant_i)... | framed(u32_LE(m)) | framed(on_behalf_of_i)... |",
    "  framed(u32_LE(k)) | (framed(ctx_ref_i) | framed(content_hash_i))... |",
    "  framed(u32_LE(f)) | (framed(feature_key_j) | framed(feature_value_j))... | policy)",
    "  features: `content.features` is caller-ordered [key, value] pairs; they are framed in ascending order of the key's",
    "  UTF-8 bytes, and a key given twice is REFUSED (never deduplicated). policy = 00 | 01 framed(policy_version) |",
    "  framed(rules_digest[32]) with rules_digest = the bound policy's policy_rules_digest (`policy_sha256`): a session vote",
    "  signs the policy its session bound at open; a one-shot vote signs 00 (server-resolved).",
    "entry_bytes = F(kind) | F(participant) | F(proposal_id) | F(value) | F(reason) | opt_conf | opt_ref,",
    "  opt_conf = 00 | 01 u64_BE(binary64 bits, -0.0 folded to +0.0); opt_ref = 00 | 01 F(rationale_ref)",
    "signed_payload = framed(`seam-voter-pop-v1`) | framed(issuer) | framed(audience) | framed(tenant) | framed(namespace) |",
    "  framed(session_id) | framed(u64_LE(opened_at_millis)) | framed(voter_aid) | framed(content_digest) |",
    "  framed(u64_LE(issued_at_ms)) | framed(u64_LE(expires_at_ms)) | framed(entry_bytes)",
    "voter_aid is `aid:pubkey:ed25519:` + unpadded base64url of the raw Ed25519 public key of seed_hex; signature_hex is the",
    "64-byte Ed25519 signature (the `VoterPop.signature` bytes).",
    "",
    "Ed25519 is deterministic, so `signature_hex` is exact. Generated by an independent Python implementation",
    "(`cryptography`), not by the Rust one. NO bless mode: a mismatch is a contract break (a v2 domain tag), not a stale fixture."
  ],
  "domain": "seam-voter-pop-v1",
  "content_domain": "seam-vote-content-v1",
